Package: m6APrediction
Title: Predict N6-Methyladenosine Sites from RNA Sequence Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("rakuyonn28-ux", email = "rakuyonn28@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts N6-methyladenosine (m6A) sites in RNA from
    sequence-derived features. The package uses a fitted random forest
    classifier to make predictions on feature table or on a single site, and reports the
    predicted probability with a Positive or Negative classification.
    Features include GC content, RNA type and region, log2-transformed exon
    length and distance to the nearest splice junction, evolutionary
    conservation, and the five-base DNA context.
License: MIT
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), randomForest
Imports: stats
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
